{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-1700280751230108419"},"published":{"$t":"2013-03-26T17:38:00.000+01:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2013-03-26T21:53:45.215+01:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Informačná tabuľa Mariková - Šimunky"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nV nedeľu 24. 3. 2013 zorganizovalo <a href=\"http://hradiska333.blogspot.sk/\" target=\"_blank\">Občianske združenie Hradiská</a> spolu s MO Matice Slovenskej Dolná Mariková a s finančnou podporou obce Dolná Mariková osadenie informačnej tabule pri slovanskom hradisku &nbsp;v lokalite<a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Doln%C3%A1%20Marikov%C3%A1%20-%20Hradisko%20%C5%A0irok%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\"> Šimunky.&nbsp;</a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguu4jpsyO8dBrjnKHLfU4uE5IksI5i2oxbtr0NLHqJ5YUo83Q2ZBQnz0x3m-V34IuxEyT07_ZN8MaOvfNdZ2oXwFj8yikyBEOu4hHtC9TgYeE-tX0hM2_uuuYcHwJqhEK_4CEvrz-jF1M/s1600/902815_493323774061505_221965132_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguu4jpsyO8dBrjnKHLfU4uE5IksI5i2oxbtr0NLHqJ5YUo83Q2ZBQnz0x3m-V34IuxEyT07_ZN8MaOvfNdZ2oXwFj8yikyBEOu4hHtC9TgYeE-tX0hM2_uuuYcHwJqhEK_4CEvrz-jF1M/s320/902815_493323774061505_221965132_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Vyniesť ťažký materiál nebolo jednoduché,<br />\n&nbsp;našťastie dosť ďaleko sme sa dostali s autom</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCX3XlwdZFIHkjRxXqdmttrXIwojEAoDYXbK5F2dAXHIWvgicvfLEui1Z28bhubCjAICGm3qcFavPov2HHC_Qlo0fm5QFjG7nnxv4vFAgF1fSWOFJf0QDBEF901nnzJTBZbs09NNaSTUo/s1600/902441_493323887394827_1030158025_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCX3XlwdZFIHkjRxXqdmttrXIwojEAoDYXbK5F2dAXHIWvgicvfLEui1Z28bhubCjAICGm3qcFavPov2HHC_Qlo0fm5QFjG7nnxv4vFAgF1fSWOFJf0QDBEF901nnzJTBZbs09NNaSTUo/s320/902441_493323887394827_1030158025_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjnNABNS1w1Zy1kS1oBcOVyMyyens42_1-eR3h37PPJA7rB26mYuEzrNi6YkUXXosxB8MwlHDhqh3yGknNCadK-FjpkjmN0CxPBFGr7MQcSTTRyVVBGYUU9qFJtEMszgq2omdwSGEXB-jA/s1600/484757_493324030728146_1921783952_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjnNABNS1w1Zy1kS1oBcOVyMyyens42_1-eR3h37PPJA7rB26mYuEzrNi6YkUXXosxB8MwlHDhqh3yGknNCadK-FjpkjmN0CxPBFGr7MQcSTTRyVVBGYUU9qFJtEMszgq2omdwSGEXB-jA/s320/484757_493324030728146_1921783952_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">hlavný nosič</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCYDWctq8x2HG_NG00iF2gfg9J7ElZY15x3hWpHyTHwteDlMn1VNwfuD68bKwLNlC0du696FGUpcz6AfsLUM8sO6_D1KQfxtvSO_48SNHO1cDiX0RyYZUk346_Y9I7U_IE-NmAUr7SdBg/s1600/884377_493325084061374_336417064_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCYDWctq8x2HG_NG00iF2gfg9J7ElZY15x3hWpHyTHwteDlMn1VNwfuD68bKwLNlC0du696FGUpcz6AfsLUM8sO6_D1KQfxtvSO_48SNHO1cDiX0RyYZUk346_Y9I7U_IE-NmAUr7SdBg/s320/884377_493325084061374_336417064_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTabuľu sme umiestnili mimo areálu hradiska, takže sme nijakým spôsobom nezasiahli do územia archeologickej lokality. &nbsp;Nachádza sa v rámci oddychoej zóny, ktorú v minulosti vybudoval turistický spolok v Dolnej Marikovej. Odteraz každý návštevník tohto výnimočného miesta, na ktorom pred 1000 rokmi žili naši slovanskí predkovia sa môže dozvedieť základné informácie o hradisku, potešiť sa z obrázkov nálezov, ktoré sa na hradisku našli a tiež sa dozvie, ako mohlo hradisko vyzerať v dobách Veľkej Moravy.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiG8iz0MiMFDuFtgvLO8L0SfvKufZOozN_WIXGHUlwhIlGj_np0JjID23DicBcsE3bkX_4f1tmFOJ4UX5NhxLIw_eaZwO__Q8QXbRXtaM2sF-xU5VsHjPwNTGpBV8f4aAy0ZJjxCxABS4Y/s1600/_DSC0118.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiG8iz0MiMFDuFtgvLO8L0SfvKufZOozN_WIXGHUlwhIlGj_np0JjID23DicBcsE3bkX_4f1tmFOJ4UX5NhxLIw_eaZwO__Q8QXbRXtaM2sF-xU5VsHjPwNTGpBV8f4aAy0ZJjxCxABS4Y/s320/_DSC0118.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Prvý kop</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhXeMmLoQOG_5xttowMjdryBWBrgZJU4EP_0VUjNIPqBDg4jPcbbWu9U8z3sK4hW86f-bf6gmTa5rsg1w638UfrkQrIwL6WjgZyHYDUjVvy_HHO6a32EFE0IMYfYq_vvFWl1XLsts7pAhw/s1600/_DSC0143.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhXeMmLoQOG_5xttowMjdryBWBrgZJU4EP_0VUjNIPqBDg4jPcbbWu9U8z3sK4hW86f-bf6gmTa5rsg1w638UfrkQrIwL6WjgZyHYDUjVvy_HHO6a32EFE0IMYfYq_vvFWl1XLsts7pAhw/s320/_DSC0143.JPG\" width=\"212\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEij3hPcB_E4Hj0jf61P7xglACT0Z-vygpiYh3j30jJ1aTqOfAodLhFij2LGm6Vz_3ngFV8JzgQTiIP_WaliBIgTNCYvz_BIHV5jvJ_SSCo0I-A1DEkL6O8S0RSsMpiBcXFvrM4mr8eBPDg/s1600/_DSC0135.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEij3hPcB_E4Hj0jf61P7xglACT0Z-vygpiYh3j30jJ1aTqOfAodLhFij2LGm6Vz_3ngFV8JzgQTiIP_WaliBIgTNCYvz_BIHV5jvJ_SSCo0I-A1DEkL6O8S0RSsMpiBcXFvrM4mr8eBPDg/s320/_DSC0135.JPG\" width=\"212\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiaeBNAoQHTd6agkr5q6pp2SV12XoxA6phHQBUcGR3LbPxJluKM7k1QQ58bCFzHGKsFJ9UminofnkNIwl_1yLJ9lbcpXhicLidCwA9xpxGF6uZNVGAKMEGbTSJOPltPYz-WQ0IEYo_-e2w/s1600/_DSC0148.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiaeBNAoQHTd6agkr5q6pp2SV12XoxA6phHQBUcGR3LbPxJluKM7k1QQ58bCFzHGKsFJ9UminofnkNIwl_1yLJ9lbcpXhicLidCwA9xpxGF6uZNVGAKMEGbTSJOPltPYz-WQ0IEYo_-e2w/s320/_DSC0148.JPG\" width=\"212\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgC0BiAJSp_l9REZJTLyi-KFYupvzhyfNSRKwWpDLcjNL1inaX0IYaOTsdkU2fBkiO251g0aYbzOQA5QBy8YBkmQrcUTsP0BNQmLCN-_yTv5I25m92J6jRcrQEjQ2iD8gCPUhXbghGWmN0/s1600/601060_493325370728012_586809437_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgC0BiAJSp_l9REZJTLyi-KFYupvzhyfNSRKwWpDLcjNL1inaX0IYaOTsdkU2fBkiO251g0aYbzOQA5QBy8YBkmQrcUTsP0BNQmLCN-_yTv5I25m92J6jRcrQEjQ2iD8gCPUhXbghGWmN0/s320/601060_493325370728012_586809437_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5e_nVZQdvQBnXMg43QkQJkmACzFrp1SEJUT6Gxj-LRo8WG_gQfXy9Ki3KOvK_USdzkiYnRRALTkj9gOh0wUbJjYF59hEqspn7NwttCq8N3uFABr1gIIyLnWEEe-H-iQjaR_fzcWn2coU/s1600/262171_493325427394673_157752341_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5e_nVZQdvQBnXMg43QkQJkmACzFrp1SEJUT6Gxj-LRo8WG_gQfXy9Ki3KOvK_USdzkiYnRRALTkj9gOh0wUbJjYF59hEqspn7NwttCq8N3uFABr1gIIyLnWEEe-H-iQjaR_fzcWn2coU/s320/262171_493325427394673_157752341_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnbOSMnJowDCJvEKCZEtGPdTqEYILdhyphenhyphenLm5i5zC1_e69GCaue3XqFKhPeRHglbMT-3wD0krAUS5fBbTrdJ5Y2KF9_iR2oSp9GBjcI1ifEKik9Vln5SscxOIH_2aTywbactCMiVveC7SQ4/s1600/_DSC0189.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnbOSMnJowDCJvEKCZEtGPdTqEYILdhyphenhyphenLm5i5zC1_e69GCaue3XqFKhPeRHglbMT-3wD0krAUS5fBbTrdJ5Y2KF9_iR2oSp9GBjcI1ifEKik9Vln5SscxOIH_2aTywbactCMiVveC7SQ4/s320/_DSC0189.JPG\" width=\"212\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLE9utMq6lk3j0iYVZCIkErVXQbHbK-BerVmnxyHkCyW2EG6w7XTOzlYS45rdmJRPGO-9lX_li9qSC8cmtOlYVG1SXVDeuyXJxCmrDUfJeiWklBXVEcNT1cm9FdN2UqqeBSxzYrw3gPFA/s1600/_DSC0182.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLE9utMq6lk3j0iYVZCIkErVXQbHbK-BerVmnxyHkCyW2EG6w7XTOzlYS45rdmJRPGO-9lX_li9qSC8cmtOlYVG1SXVDeuyXJxCmrDUfJeiWklBXVEcNT1cm9FdN2UqqeBSxzYrw3gPFA/s320/_DSC0182.JPG\" width=\"212\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2PJQhoRUkUgDN8Hb5DCYzNtUbbXhWwx5nn-twveridBTodSQkWVebUI-Bx5xZpK_LMO1O99CU-5LK_vmjwSIBK7s3BroDSDI3SuE7w715CJijfJylh-JNUF8W6MAk9q9o_DQ7qSmd9PA/s1600/892330_493326457394570_2098899852_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2PJQhoRUkUgDN8Hb5DCYzNtUbbXhWwx5nn-twveridBTodSQkWVebUI-Bx5xZpK_LMO1O99CU-5LK_vmjwSIBK7s3BroDSDI3SuE7w715CJijfJylh-JNUF8W6MAk9q9o_DQ7qSmd9PA/s320/892330_493326457394570_2098899852_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNa našu veľkú radosť, naše pozvanie prijal aj objaviteľ hradiska, pán Gašpar Zemančík, ktorý spolu s &nbsp;archeológom Jozefom Moravčíkom a so Štefanom Melišom našli v minulosti na hradisku množstvo výnimočných nálezov.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCVDmjlVvQXHZMTrJMMmAHaNrCTtV8XVDwIqFSEjlbL3enVa6-UR8aFMiaEW5MCc3HjLcDyYAGZEXZRjdfYXkz96TVkuMOeJ9QvqDgYPusaw5NEjDo5r5pYHfHdxI5k7WZ55lfFT6swls/s1600/DSC_1726.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCVDmjlVvQXHZMTrJMMmAHaNrCTtV8XVDwIqFSEjlbL3enVa6-UR8aFMiaEW5MCc3HjLcDyYAGZEXZRjdfYXkz96TVkuMOeJ9QvqDgYPusaw5NEjDo5r5pYHfHdxI5k7WZ55lfFT6swls/s320/DSC_1726.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Po dobre odvedenej práci čakáme na živánsku</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgrVop8PBIQLcOCtBBOcV9SMjki9Du6Rf4fH5rYPGUhS7ir6ezv3TmxrvazawAscFFxZfKDSZ8R85HnUai1ivfUtjR6AY4hadZDJ_YZg6COca9tB9cjBwi0_mk22Rci4gARAauY7sZVJ2Y/s1600/DSCN2496.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgrVop8PBIQLcOCtBBOcV9SMjki9Du6Rf4fH5rYPGUhS7ir6ezv3TmxrvazawAscFFxZfKDSZ8R85HnUai1ivfUtjR6AY4hadZDJ_YZg6COca9tB9cjBwi0_mk22Rci4gARAauY7sZVJ2Y/s320/DSCN2496.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhrLx-LDawN6_9hpztDf-NRIGhe1r5ZW4Hrah9wJnkUdeG2NiUOhzR83gnaEkFbegzR_wY8Tg7UPDfLomQjRwy_F61iFbkdhG-Gi8ezc6ByCajwA_H5vGp_R0rgAtN3Plh0ugBpV98SYU4/s1600/DSCN2499.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhrLx-LDawN6_9hpztDf-NRIGhe1r5ZW4Hrah9wJnkUdeG2NiUOhzR83gnaEkFbegzR_wY8Tg7UPDfLomQjRwy_F61iFbkdhG-Gi8ezc6ByCajwA_H5vGp_R0rgAtN3Plh0ugBpV98SYU4/s320/DSCN2499.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tabuľu slávnostne odhalil Čendo Žrec. Pokrstili sme ju symbolicky - vínom Nitrianske knieža...</span><br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi0N34tMFyp1h8JjjGPN4yuasmnI-NyBJ4oyPHIfnzmOWw1coc-TGj9rXrCRLkAugUYId0T0yA1LtuwX0IWhotsm6K8FvVOORvktOZggRosL1wX5hcGiJobPq2JRi3bG-NXsucEqhAE__Y/s1600/DSCN2494.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi0N34tMFyp1h8JjjGPN4yuasmnI-NyBJ4oyPHIfnzmOWw1coc-TGj9rXrCRLkAugUYId0T0yA1LtuwX0IWhotsm6K8FvVOORvktOZggRosL1wX5hcGiJobPq2JRi3bG-NXsucEqhAE__Y/s320/DSCN2494.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjwuPlRpX_ILPBXfT412_XRcXNohAPqhg-ixAmGI5yzZkQMnmeEw9k7yBUbflx-ZxpEVS2dQYmThHdEo1i9771GeR-AfVOAu4uRhyphenhyphenmaMOF4eULHOQOfZn2Ic_pqUf7QcaVCh6kXhOGtv4o/s1600/DSC_1732.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjwuPlRpX_ILPBXfT412_XRcXNohAPqhg-ixAmGI5yzZkQMnmeEw9k7yBUbflx-ZxpEVS2dQYmThHdEo1i9771GeR-AfVOAu4uRhyphenhyphenmaMOF4eULHOQOfZn2Ic_pqUf7QcaVCh6kXhOGtv4o/s320/DSC_1732.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Odhaľovanie tabule</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjitlBkWYVWvCpDo_uZ1nFzMATMyNCBvwNSl2bIN4677o6gqc4UAMf2Bh9lSE2q0OlY8SjEm8yaDTXnKkL17Q5jEgoViUoQ7ZDlNO58MCNNXHNx1lZrTvmnFcN9-rLWbxW7AcNwIrgLgEA/s1600/DSCN2509.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjitlBkWYVWvCpDo_uZ1nFzMATMyNCBvwNSl2bIN4677o6gqc4UAMf2Bh9lSE2q0OlY8SjEm8yaDTXnKkL17Q5jEgoViUoQ7ZDlNO58MCNNXHNx1lZrTvmnFcN9-rLWbxW7AcNwIrgLgEA/s320/DSCN2509.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Nitrianske knieža</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg6tNYBg9gdrVTKIpncoxTcDRsA0n66Hi64WM0q6Y-0VEjNpTXh1tmSPjjCzu2bu45Rqmyc-SkMjV-f4a2fEaiN8ouylYgOa-KiFrkkOkYC-gRHKPzMoIrXyGNNXxPIC0o7tpaZESncrb4/s1600/892364_493328324061050_1393695519_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg6tNYBg9gdrVTKIpncoxTcDRsA0n66Hi64WM0q6Y-0VEjNpTXh1tmSPjjCzu2bu45Rqmyc-SkMjV-f4a2fEaiN8ouylYgOa-KiFrkkOkYC-gRHKPzMoIrXyGNNXxPIC0o7tpaZESncrb4/s320/892364_493328324061050_1393695519_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjTfopGZpk189aIUKSzcnhb_I9gSkgstfynpUMeZ-4vtypnf0mh40i4lXI3E9Eq6r37_z0LbIEnftG85aG7hjm3bmWPDhma7RTAFx4TlbN8WFIYOq3oKL3gBy5MJWmDBeV0g7WzcpXTQBk/s1600/DSC_1741.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjTfopGZpk189aIUKSzcnhb_I9gSkgstfynpUMeZ-4vtypnf0mh40i4lXI3E9Eq6r37_z0LbIEnftG85aG7hjm3bmWPDhma7RTAFx4TlbN8WFIYOq3oKL3gBy5MJWmDBeV0g7WzcpXTQBk/s320/DSC_1741.JPG\" width=\"240\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">A tu je tabuľa</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPLG4a1aNocJ5CeM9DLGui6R3G9_w5Xn0kBINz7qbxzDh1TRLxRHm7HxV6DQ7CCuNA6EwkfSeaGEmx1pyc5GXA_QtM2zICWGfxtsJu5Bah_nwxSgJ0IcDSu_NJqpwtU_VNRwIbPxbTAj4/s1600/883829_493327550727794_1292980250_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPLG4a1aNocJ5CeM9DLGui6R3G9_w5Xn0kBINz7qbxzDh1TRLxRHm7HxV6DQ7CCuNA6EwkfSeaGEmx1pyc5GXA_QtM2zICWGfxtsJu5Bah_nwxSgJ0IcDSu_NJqpwtU_VNRwIbPxbTAj4/s320/883829_493327550727794_1292980250_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgzgaGO5mb47Ebsb22yeT_nWtr4gO76PDU4bc_WQuPr9ZbixkQX5Ov15p5DKSo51aVBhqtKFxMpzrzbS1FhImNV8lP33rRgHseit_nl2j5dktIJotpSnNrintL3K99qnn69-AdDHj3YUk8/s1600/221662_493328464061036_1188736780_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgzgaGO5mb47Ebsb22yeT_nWtr4gO76PDU4bc_WQuPr9ZbixkQX5Ov15p5DKSo51aVBhqtKFxMpzrzbS1FhImNV8lP33rRgHseit_nl2j5dktIJotpSnNrintL3K99qnn69-AdDHj3YUk8/s320/221662_493328464061036_1188736780_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Slovanskí bohovia nám dopriali luxusné počasie. Nadšenie a dobrú náladu sme si priviezli so sebou a veru, tí čo prišli určite neoľutovali.</span><br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjBO4jQwx8_4aNNx82BfdbYXlaQuT5lb4SB5dCHIMRM6gIwC_3BVAs7bfgPAneKcperFtqs8D89nqXLcFLPvDGACUHi518J3JHPupc1AupcvcHjNRJyc0LtlBuxVRQN_7Pkeq4_YmRY8iM/s1600/DSC_1736.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjBO4jQwx8_4aNNx82BfdbYXlaQuT5lb4SB5dCHIMRM6gIwC_3BVAs7bfgPAneKcperFtqs8D89nqXLcFLPvDGACUHi518J3JHPupc1AupcvcHjNRJyc0LtlBuxVRQN_7Pkeq4_YmRY8iM/s320/DSC_1736.JPG\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiPkFqhBJPnYAzjZmANZx6bqu7HPDsKV0jfW_732ti6GVQgmLOCpoXd2s_uTdNXrHb4fDtnTDPo0_aTgF4u15PfZAdTAu3JNxqD84B_2HwNnhH98Nfzk-Rchrr9ZjVkG2adANS0C2YS5Aw/s1600/DSCN2516.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiPkFqhBJPnYAzjZmANZx6bqu7HPDsKV0jfW_732ti6GVQgmLOCpoXd2s_uTdNXrHb4fDtnTDPo0_aTgF4u15PfZAdTAu3JNxqD84B_2HwNnhH98Nfzk-Rchrr9ZjVkG2adANS0C2YS5Aw/s320/DSCN2516.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nĎakujem všetkým, ktorí sa na tomto našom prvom projekte zúčastnili za nezištnú pomoc, &nbsp;majiteľovi pozemku za ústretovosť a starostovi Dolnej Marikovej za &nbsp;finančnú podporu tabule.<br />\n<br />\nTešíme sa na ďalšiu tabuľu, ktorú by sme chceli umiestniť na hradiku Pružina - Mesciská a Hatné Hrádok. Kto je ochotný podporiť naše združenie, <a href=\"http://hradiska333.blogspot.sk/\" target=\"_blank\">tu sú potrebné údaje..</a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>Foto:</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nSammi</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nMiroslav Bros</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nPeter Bros</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"http://www.mhphoto.sk/\" target=\"_blank\">Martin Hodoník</a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nOrgoň&nbsp;</div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/1700280751230108419/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/03/informacna-tabula-marikova-simunky.html#comment-form","title":"2 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/1700280751230108419"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/1700280751230108419"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/03/informacna-tabula-marikova-simunky.html","title":"Informačná tabuľa Mariková - Šimunky"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguu4jpsyO8dBrjnKHLfU4uE5IksI5i2oxbtr0NLHqJ5YUo83Q2ZBQnz0x3m-